@startuml

autonumber
hide footbox
title SSD: US011 - Add publication to library

actor "User" as User
participant ":System" as System

activate User

    User -> System : I want to add a publication to my library
    activate System

    System --> User : Here's the list of publications, select one!

    User -> System: selected a publication

    System --> User: done!
    deactivate System

deactivate User
@enduml